  "starterCode": "# KV Compression \u2014 reconstructed educational contract\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef solution(x, rank):\n    # TODO: implement the operation described in the problem statement\n    pass\n",
  "solution": "### \ud83d\udca1 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **KV Compression** by following direct architectural principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### \u26a1 Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\ndef solution(x, rank):\n    x=np.asarray(x,dtype=float)\n    u,s,vt=np.linalg.svd(x,full_matrices=False); r=max(1,min(int(rank),len(s)))\n    return {\"u\":u[:,:r].tolist(),\"s\":s[:r].tolist(),\"vt\":vt[:r,:].tolist()}\n```\n\n### \u23f1\ufe0f Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the primary sequence length or dimension.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
